WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:40.337 --> 00:00:46.160
... of the subtler side of our being.

00:00:46.160 --> 00:00:54.160
What we know grossly as human beings,
we only know that we are this body.

00:00:54.160 --> 00:00:57.120
Also, some of us know
that we are this ego.

00:00:58.080 --> 00:01:05.200
And some of us know that we are
this ‘mana’ or we call it superego.

00:01:05.200 --> 00:01:12.640
The subtler side of life can only
be known to us if we become subtler.

00:01:12.640 --> 00:01:20.160
On the gross level, we know
what we can just feel through our senses.

00:01:20.160 --> 00:01:26.160
But the same senses that look so gross
to us, also have a subtler source.

00:01:28.720 --> 00:01:37.520
Within us lies this beautiful instrument.
This is the ‘tantra’,

00:01:37.520 --> 00:01:44.400
the complete instrument through
which Kundalini has to pass.

00:01:44.400 --> 00:01:51.360
This whole instrument that is shown here
exists within us in a very subtle form.

00:01:52.880 --> 00:02:04.640
First of all, if you see clearly, you see
a white line starting from the right side,

00:02:04.640 --> 00:02:20.240
passing through the left side, goes down.
This is the line that expresses the subtle

00:02:20.240 --> 00:02:24.680
power, the Shakti within us,
which gives us our desires.

00:02:24.680 --> 00:02:31.120
It is the desiring Power
by which we desire.

00:02:31.120 --> 00:02:37.280
In Sahaja Yoga language,
it is called as Mahakali Power.

00:02:37.280 --> 00:02:41.760
This is the first.
Because if you do not have the desire,

00:02:41.760 --> 00:02:45.840
you are not going to act upon it.
First, the desire has to be there.

00:02:45.840 --> 00:02:49.760
So, this is the first Power
that exists within us in a subtle form,

00:02:49.760 --> 00:02:52.560
inside the spinal cord
and inside the brain,

00:02:52.560 --> 00:03:01.040
called as Mahakali Power.
This Power is expressed outside,

00:03:01.040 --> 00:03:06.160
in the gross
and left sympathetic nervous system.

00:03:06.160 --> 00:03:08.720
On the right-hand side,
there is another Power

00:03:08.720 --> 00:03:13.120
which comes from the left-hand side,
passes through, goes down.

00:03:13.120 --> 00:03:16.800
And this power is the power through
which we act.

00:03:16.800 --> 00:03:28.720
First, we desire, and then we act. So,
this is the Power of action, Kriya Shakti.

00:03:28.720 --> 00:03:34.240
This is the Power through which we create;
we achieve our desires.

00:03:34.240 --> 00:03:42.080
And this Power exists in the gross
as the right sympathetic nervous system.

00:03:42.080 --> 00:03:51.040
In the Sahaja Yoga language,
it is called Mahasaraswati, Mahasaraswati.

00:03:51.040 --> 00:03:55.920
This Power is Mahasaraswati.

00:03:55.920 --> 00:04:01.200
In Bombay, we have all these three
Powers expressed through the Mother Earth

00:04:01.200 --> 00:04:05.440
as Mahakali, Mahalakshmi,
Mahasaraswati in this Mahalakshmi temple.

00:04:05.440 --> 00:04:11.840
It’s a fact. That’s a living thing
that has come out of the Mother Earth.

00:04:11.840 --> 00:04:16.720
It’s a fact. Those who are Realized
can gradually go and see.

00:04:16.720 --> 00:04:24.400
But the way we are treating them,
there’s a big cloud on top of it.

00:04:24.400 --> 00:04:27.680
The way we treat these Powers
is very important.

00:04:27.680 --> 00:04:34.240
People call possessed woman
and ask them for the number of horses.

00:04:34.240 --> 00:04:39.280
This is absolute insult of God.
And curses will fall upon us,

00:04:39.280 --> 00:04:47.280
if we do not heed to the protocol of God.
It’s the most holy shrine we have.

00:04:47.280 --> 00:04:53.200
And we have to respect all our shrines,
whether it’s a masjid or a mandir.

00:04:53.200 --> 00:04:55.200
We have to respect it.

00:04:55.200 --> 00:05:05.520
But we are not to be so disrespectful
that the curses of God will fall upon us.

00:05:05.520 --> 00:05:12.080
This is the other side of Sahaja Yoga
which teaches you how you should really

00:05:12.080 --> 00:05:15.040
establish your Realization
within yourself.

00:05:15.040 --> 00:05:19.200
By accepting the truth through
your vibratory awareness,

00:05:19.200 --> 00:05:25.360
you can understand the truth about a
place, and you have to establish it.

00:05:25.360 --> 00:05:30.600
Like in London where I live, in front
of my house, there is a very big church.

00:05:30.600 --> 00:05:37.280
And it’s a very famous old church
called Westminster Church, Cathedral.

00:05:37.280 --> 00:05:40.880
And in that church, the only activity
I see the whole day is nothing

00:05:40.880 --> 00:05:45.760
but emptying of beer bottles
and beer cans, and I don’t know

00:05:45.760 --> 00:05:50.880
what sort of big bottles they have.
And inside the church, they have buried

00:05:50.880 --> 00:05:58.240
all kinds of horrible kings, this,
that, bishops, all unrealized people.

00:05:58.240 --> 00:06:01.760
The whole place.
Though it’s a beautiful construction

00:06:01.760 --> 00:06:06.480
and has vibrations no doubt,
it’s completely polluted.

00:06:06.480 --> 00:06:09.680
We have not only polluted the atmosphere
or the sea or anything,

00:06:09.680 --> 00:06:13.600
we have polluted the Divinity.
And the divine Spirit,

00:06:13.600 --> 00:06:18.000
the Divinity, the Holy Ghost,
or the Bhagavati as she said,

00:06:18.000 --> 00:06:24.000
disappears from such filthy places
where you are disrespected.

00:06:24.000 --> 00:06:30.080
You wouldn’t go to a place
where you are not respected.

00:06:30.080 --> 00:06:38.960
In the centre, lies a very important power
which is the power of sustenance,

00:06:38.960 --> 00:06:43.400
by which we get our quality,
as I told you yesterday.

00:06:43.400 --> 00:06:48.800
It is the power of Mahalakshmi.
Now these words are in Sanskrit,

00:06:48.800 --> 00:06:51.920
makes no difference.
Even if you are a Muslim

00:06:51.920 --> 00:06:57.920
or a Christian or a Hindu or anything,
in Sahaja Yoga you are a human being.

00:06:57.920 --> 00:07:02.240
And Sanskrit language was actually
not originated in India alone,

00:07:02.240 --> 00:07:05.280
for your information.
It was in Norway

00:07:05.280 --> 00:07:09.680
that Sanskrit was made Sanskrit
and then it travelled down to India.

00:07:09.680 --> 00:07:11.440
So, if Indians think
that is their language,

00:07:11.440 --> 00:07:14.720
they are also sadly mistaken.
This kind of foolish ideas

00:07:14.720 --> 00:07:20.000
we have because the first primordial
language was converted into Sanskrit,

00:07:20.000 --> 00:07:25.040
and also, then it was the primordial
language converted into Latin.

00:07:25.040 --> 00:07:27.120
And Latin was taken
over by other countries,

00:07:27.120 --> 00:07:32.160
and Sanskrit was brought to India and was,
of course, made more Sanskrit. ‘Sankrita’.

00:07:32.160 --> 00:07:35.160
‘San’ means holy, made holy.
Now, how do you make a language holy?

00:07:35.160 --> 00:07:37.840
It is through the awakening
of the Kundalini.

00:07:37.840 --> 00:07:42.800
When she moves, she makes a sound.
And that sound was seen in this great

00:07:42.800 --> 00:07:47.120
country of yours which is a Yoga country,
which is the country of seers

00:07:47.120 --> 00:07:52.560
and saints and not people
who are dealing in economic projections,

00:07:52.560 --> 00:07:58.320
but people who are dealing inside
to the main power, the Brahma Shakti.

00:07:58.320 --> 00:08:02.080
The main Power
that creates all the powers of the world.

00:08:02.080 --> 00:08:04.880
And they are the people
who cleared this language

00:08:04.880 --> 00:08:10.480
and made it phonetic, ‘devanagari’,
because they heard these sounds coming up,

00:08:10.480 --> 00:08:16.240
and when these sounds come up,
then you know what centre it is touching.

00:08:16.240 --> 00:08:21.600
That’s why all our mantras
have a very great scientific basis.

00:08:21.600 --> 00:08:25.200
Now I have seen also that people just
will give you a name, “All right, now…”.

00:08:26.160 --> 00:08:29.120
From where they got this idea,
God only knows?

00:08:29.120 --> 00:08:32.480
It’s a very big science.
You cannot just ask somebody to say ‘Ram,

00:08:32.480 --> 00:08:35.600
Ram’. On the contrary,
Rama will be angry, as I told you.

00:08:35.600 --> 00:08:41.280
In the same way, this science, complete
science of mantra must be understood after

00:08:41.280 --> 00:08:45.440
Realization with a complete enlightenment
and understanding.

00:08:45.440 --> 00:08:49.120
If you are going to carry
on with your old mundane type of nonsense,

00:08:49.120 --> 00:08:54.560
you cannot progress in Sahaja Yoga.
This is absolutely authentic and ancient,

00:08:54.560 --> 00:09:00.000
but all ancient things have been covered
and clouded as our Mahalakshmi temple.

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:03.120
Imagine to have a racehorse
in front of Mahalakshmi.

00:09:03.120 --> 00:09:11.040
No wonder people in Bombay lose their
money so suddenly and become paupers.

00:09:11.040 --> 00:09:15.280
This is the curse of Mahalakshmi
on the people who go to play horses

00:09:15.280 --> 00:09:20.240
and waste their energy
on nonsensical things there.

00:09:20.240 --> 00:09:25.600
Now this first chakra within us
which gives us sustenance,

00:09:25.600 --> 00:09:29.520
the first sustenance,
the dharma, ‘dharaki sa dharma’.

00:09:29.520 --> 00:09:34.240
The sustenance that is given
to our ‘jiva’ is of innocence.

00:09:35.440 --> 00:09:43.520
The whole world was created, but before
creating the world, it was innocent.

00:09:43.520 --> 00:09:50.000
This innocence is represented
in the form of Shri Ganesha.

00:09:50.000 --> 00:09:52.800
In us also Shri Ganesha
exists at that point.

00:09:52.800 --> 00:09:55.520
The other day, I spoke
for one hour on Shri Ganesha,

00:09:55.520 --> 00:10:00.240
how the magnetic force
of the Mother Earth decides in that.

00:10:00.240 --> 00:10:07.360
A person whose Shri Ganesha is completely
awakened, does not have to use a compass.

00:10:07.360 --> 00:10:11.280
Wherever he is, he knows
which is the north, which is the south.

00:10:11.280 --> 00:10:14.400
He has a compass within him.
Like the birds have it.

00:10:14.400 --> 00:10:18.560
That’s how they can fly all the way
from Siberia and go to Australia,

00:10:18.560 --> 00:10:22.400
without knowing any map, without
knowing anything, because they follow

00:10:22.400 --> 00:10:29.040
their path through their compass,
that they have got Shri Ganesha.

00:10:29.040 --> 00:10:34.560
When this Ganesh’s tattva
is awakened in a human being,

00:10:34.560 --> 00:10:39.520
such a person walks very lightly.
He may have a weight because Ganesha,

00:10:39.520 --> 00:10:44.000
you know, is a Lambodhara and all that.
But his whole thing is very light.

00:10:44.000 --> 00:10:46.960
In his movement, in everything,
he is very light.

00:10:46.960 --> 00:10:49.840
When he walks,
he can walk quite fast.

00:10:49.840 --> 00:10:51.360
But that’s not the only sign.

00:10:51.360 --> 00:10:55.520
I am saying it is one of the things
that one can get out of it.

00:10:55.520 --> 00:11:00.800
But this Mooladhara chakra is the most
important chakra for all of us.

00:11:00.800 --> 00:11:02.800
In Maharashtra,
we should really bless ourselves

00:11:02.800 --> 00:11:07.680
that all Ashta Vinayaka are here.
The Mother Earth has created

00:11:07.680 --> 00:11:13.440
in this great country of yours,
in Maharashtra only, the Ashta Vinayaka.

00:11:13.440 --> 00:11:16.880
Now whether they are living or not,
I cannot talk to people who are blind, but

00:11:16.880 --> 00:11:20.880
who have got Realization can go and see
for themselves if it is true or not.

00:11:22.000 --> 00:11:26.400
Even your Mount Mary statue
is a Realized statue.

00:11:26.400 --> 00:11:30.640
Now this Ganesha tattva,
this principle of Ganesha is within us.

00:11:30.640 --> 00:11:41.280
The more we start becoming intelligent
and cunning, this innocence is lost.

00:11:41.280 --> 00:11:45.440
It is not only mental,
it can be also physical, like in the West,

00:11:45.440 --> 00:11:50.240
where people have lost their sense
of morality, Ganesha is finished.

00:11:50.240 --> 00:11:54.240
Ganesha is innocent
and imagine it was Christ

00:11:54.240 --> 00:12:00.080
who incarnated
from this principle of Ganesha.

00:12:00.080 --> 00:12:03.600
He is the incarnation
of Ganesha principle.

00:12:03.600 --> 00:12:10.320
And imagine that all these Western
countries are just going against Christ,

00:12:10.320 --> 00:12:15.600
who taught
that the first thing is to have innocence.

00:12:15.600 --> 00:12:20.400
He said that, “They have said,
‘Thou shalt not commit adultery’.

00:12:20.400 --> 00:12:26.720
I say that thou shalt
not have adulterous eyes”.

00:12:26.720 --> 00:12:31.680
Now you go to any Christian nation, you’ll
be amazed their eyes are never steady.

00:12:31.680 --> 00:12:35.040
All the time they are looking like that.
I don’t understand what they are doing.

00:12:35.040 --> 00:12:37.280
Even in Bombay,
you find people like that.

00:12:37.280 --> 00:12:41.360
Their eyes are never steady.
Their steadiness is gone.

00:12:41.920 --> 00:12:45.680
So, first of all, you must ask
Shri Ganesha to give you steadiness

00:12:45.680 --> 00:12:52.000
and stability and not ask some sort
of an absurd Western stuff,

00:12:52.000 --> 00:12:55.120
by that it makes you feel
like a romantic hero.

00:12:55.120 --> 00:12:58.960
You must have your own dignity
like Ganesha has his own innocence.

00:12:58.960 --> 00:13:02.160
And this innocence you find
still in our villages.

00:13:02.160 --> 00:13:05.200
It is there.
That’s why, I’ve seen those people,

00:13:05.200 --> 00:13:08.400
who have come from the West,
like to go to the villages

00:13:08.400 --> 00:13:11.840
and see those innocent people,
and pay their respect to them.

00:13:11.840 --> 00:13:15.360
They are so simple,
so poor but they are not poor.

00:13:15.360 --> 00:13:17.200
They have not lost their innocence.

00:13:17.200 --> 00:13:20.720
If you have lost your innocence,
you are good for nothing.

00:13:20.720 --> 00:13:23.520
But when I say this,
we should not feel guilty about it.

00:13:23.520 --> 00:13:25.760
Because I am saying this to you,
just to tell you.

00:13:25.760 --> 00:13:28.560
But actually, before Me,
you have got innocence.

00:13:28.560 --> 00:13:31.360
When you are sitting before Me,
your innocence is established,

00:13:31.360 --> 00:13:34.240
because I am your Mother.
So, you should not feel guilty also.

00:13:34.240 --> 00:13:36.080
At this time some people
just start feeling guilty.

00:13:36.080 --> 00:13:38.880
Please, don’t feel guilty,
that will create another problem.

00:13:38.880 --> 00:13:43.840
So, this innocence is within us.
It is just to be awakened.

00:13:43.840 --> 00:13:47.680
But the problem with Ganesha
is that nobody can approach him,

00:13:47.680 --> 00:13:52.400
because you see he is placed there.
He just receives information

00:13:52.400 --> 00:13:57.760
when you put your hands towards Me
like this, and he informs the Kundalini,

00:13:57.760 --> 00:14:04.400
which is the Gauri, the Virgin,
which is sitting there in the sacred bone.

00:14:04.400 --> 00:14:09.280
When he gives the information
from your hands, you see from the top,

00:14:09.280 --> 00:14:15.360
the hands here, from the Vishudhi Chakra,
the information goes down by these two,

00:14:15.360 --> 00:14:19.840
Mahakali and Mahasaraswati,
or you can call it the Ida

00:14:19.840 --> 00:14:23.440
and Pingala channels, down,
and then he gets the information

00:14:23.440 --> 00:14:27.440
and he informs that,
“Now the time has come,

00:14:27.440 --> 00:14:31.680
that the Mother is there,
that the Sahaja Yogi is there”.

00:14:31.680 --> 00:14:33.840
The Kundalini rises quite spontaneously.

00:14:37.200 --> 00:14:43.360
This Ganesha is very nicely settled down.
There are four sub-plexuses to it.

00:14:43.360 --> 00:14:48.960
It controls the sex, the other
excretory organs, excretory organs.

00:14:48.960 --> 00:14:53.840
Now those people who say such things,
I feel like taking out my shoes

00:14:53.840 --> 00:14:58.560
and chappals like that,
that you can achieve God through sex,

00:14:58.560 --> 00:15:03.200
are the greatest sinners that are ever
born on the face of this earth.

00:15:04.160 --> 00:15:07.360
Thank God Indians
are not enamoured by such talks!

00:15:07.360 --> 00:15:12.080
But these all will go to Hell and all
their disciples are going to go to Hell.

00:15:12.080 --> 00:15:15.600
Such horrible people cannot
bear to even smell a flower,

00:15:15.600 --> 00:15:20.400
while we say that God is fond of flowers,
is fond of Sugandha [fragrance].

00:15:20.400 --> 00:15:23.920
All such horrible talks
and topics that people talk of,

00:15:23.920 --> 00:15:28.960
just to earn some money, or to play
upon the weaknesses of other people,

00:15:28.960 --> 00:15:36.480
must be realised, that by doing this,
they are creating such a horrible crime

00:15:36.480 --> 00:15:40.480
that when they go to Hell
they will not come back,

00:15:40.480 --> 00:15:44.800
whatever they may try.
Don’t listen to such things.

00:15:44.800 --> 00:15:48.000
Sex is a thing absolutely private
and individual.

00:15:48.000 --> 00:15:52.080
It is not a thing to be described outside
and talked about.

00:15:52.080 --> 00:15:54.720
And we Indians understand
what it means.

00:15:54.720 --> 00:15:59.040
You have to preserve your innocence
and your proper married life as it is.

00:15:59.040 --> 00:16:04.960
Shri Ganesha is one who is so innocent
that even there, at excretory points also,

00:16:04.960 --> 00:16:16.240
he is innocent and fragrant like a lotus.
Lotus in the mire, in the filth and dirt,

00:16:16.240 --> 00:16:19.680
breaks out its fragrance
and makes the whole atmosphere fragrant.

00:16:19.680 --> 00:16:23.760
It is Shri Ganesha
who is sitting there within us.

00:16:23.760 --> 00:16:27.600
Once you enlighten it, you’ll be amazed,
you’ll start getting your own fragrance.

00:16:27.600 --> 00:16:30.480
You’ll feel that there’s fragrance
coming to you from where?

00:16:30.480 --> 00:16:32.960
From where this beautiful
fragrance is coming to you?

00:16:32.960 --> 00:16:34.960
And you’ll be surprised
is the Mother Earth

00:16:34.960 --> 00:16:38.480
who has all the fragrances within Her,
has given you this fragrance

00:16:38.480 --> 00:16:42.240
in this Mooladhara Chakra
which is made by her.

00:16:42.240 --> 00:16:46.240
It is the Mother Earth
who has given a special type of ‘chandana’

00:16:46.240 --> 00:16:50.960
[sandalwood] to make this beautiful centre
that you have, and do not waste it,

00:16:50.960 --> 00:16:56.000
and do not spoil it, and do not malign
it and make it unholy, by the foolish

00:16:56.000 --> 00:16:59.360
and stupid things these people
are teaching just to make some money

00:16:59.360 --> 00:17:03.920
and have some sort of a Mercedes car
or some sort of a nonsensical thing.

00:17:03.920 --> 00:17:08.880
They will have to pay for it, no doubt,
but you please don’t, don’t get there.

00:17:08.880 --> 00:17:10.320
Never listen to such people,

00:17:10.320 --> 00:17:15.520
even if you have to see their photographs,
close your eyes.

00:17:15.520 --> 00:17:23.520
The second point is the Chakra of Nabhi.
I take it second, because in generation,

00:17:23.520 --> 00:17:28.320
it came first.
The second one is the Nabhi Chakra.

00:17:28.320 --> 00:17:38.000
This is the centre which is placed below,
behind the navel, in the spinal cord,

00:17:38.000 --> 00:17:44.880
and is for our evolution.
We start our evolution through seeking.

00:17:44.880 --> 00:17:48.000
First, we seek food,
then we seek something else and seek…

00:17:48.000 --> 00:17:52.720
When we come to human state,
we start seeking, for example, money.

00:17:52.720 --> 00:17:57.520
We start seeking power.
We start seeking love of other people.

00:17:57.520 --> 00:18:03.520
We seek something. But when we go
to the extremes of these things,

00:18:03.520 --> 00:18:08.160
without any consideration to dharma –
dharma is surrounding,

00:18:08.160 --> 00:18:10.720
the whole is surrounded by dharma,
is our sustenance,

00:18:10.720 --> 00:18:16.480
are the ten powers of sustenance – when
we do not pay any attention to our dharma…

00:18:16.480 --> 00:18:22.720
supposing a man, he holds lot of sugar
and makes people starve.

00:18:22.720 --> 00:18:26.000
A man who may be a vegetarian
or all nonsense of that,

00:18:26.000 --> 00:18:29.680
and he is trying to torture the poor
people, he loses his dharma.

00:18:29.680 --> 00:18:32.480
There is no compassion.
There is no love in it.

00:18:32.480 --> 00:18:36.880
Such a man is lost to Sahaja Yoga.
Any kind of extreme, for example,

00:18:36.880 --> 00:18:41.708
supposing you are very fond of eating,
also you can spoil it.

00:18:41.708 --> 00:18:41.760
If you are a miserly person,
definitely you spoil it.

00:18:41.760 --> 00:18:49.200
If you are a miserly person,
you go to another extreme.

00:18:49.200 --> 00:18:52.000
If you are a person who is fasting
all the time, also you spoil it.

00:18:52.000 --> 00:18:58.720
Any kind of extreme behaviour spoils
your centres. This is the basic fact.

00:18:58.720 --> 00:19:04.400
And any such thing takes you away
from the centre and takes you away…

00:19:04.400 --> 00:19:07.520
What happens to him?
He starts thinking he is God.

00:19:07.520 --> 00:19:12.160
He starts thinking he is God Almighty.
He becomes very hot-tempered.

00:19:12.160 --> 00:19:15.920
He will starve. But let him starve,
but he gets hot-tempered.

00:19:15.920 --> 00:19:18.800
He shouts at people.
He will be screaming.,

00:19:19.440 --> 00:19:23.520
and if he has a fasting day, early
in the morning run away from the house.

00:19:23.520 --> 00:19:26.000
Just be sure if he is fasting today,
that means you, a headache.

00:19:27.280 --> 00:19:31.280
Such people are extremely dry.
They have no love for others except

00:19:31.280 --> 00:19:35.760
for showing off that they are fasting
today or tomorrow or the day after.

00:19:35.760 --> 00:19:38.720
There is no need
for you to fast now after Sahaja Yoga.

00:19:38.720 --> 00:19:40.800
Of course,
you must learn the balancing of food.

00:19:40.800 --> 00:19:44.480
It’s a different point.
But every time one starts fasting.

00:19:44.480 --> 00:19:51.120
Like on a day when somebody is born,
say, Ganesha is born on Sankashti.

00:19:51.120 --> 00:19:53.040
What is the use of fasting on that day?

00:19:53.040 --> 00:19:55.680
Is that the day to fast
or to give a feast?

00:19:55.680 --> 00:19:59.760
There’s a child, Ganesha,
born in your country.

00:19:59.760 --> 00:20:01.920
You are fasting!
What is this?

00:20:01.920 --> 00:20:08.000
All sorts of just positions,
rituals like these.

00:20:08.000 --> 00:20:12.480
For example, Rama is to be born: fast.
Krishna is born: fast.

00:20:12.480 --> 00:20:15.200
Why should you fast on the day
when Shri Krishna was born?

00:20:15.200 --> 00:20:21.040
I can’t understand. Is this a way
to celebrate the birthday of anyone?

00:20:21.040 --> 00:20:23.520
I don’t understand from where
did we get this idea

00:20:23.520 --> 00:20:28.480
that we should fast
when there is somebody’s birthday.

00:20:28.480 --> 00:20:31.360
If you try such tricks
and if you do these things,

00:20:31.360 --> 00:20:34.400
your Vishudhi Chakra,
your Vishuddhi Chakra

00:20:34.400 --> 00:20:40.160
because of Shri Krishna and this because
of your eating habits is false.

00:20:40.160 --> 00:20:44.800
Sahaja Yoga is to be understood
in its entire truthfulness.

00:20:44.800 --> 00:20:46.640
There is no falsehood about Sahaja Yoga.

00:20:46.640 --> 00:20:49.840
If you still keep your false ideas,
then you will not progress in Sahaja Yoga.

00:20:49.840 --> 00:20:55.680
It’s absolutely truthful
and you have to see what it is.

00:20:55.680 --> 00:20:59.840
The people who overeat,
whose attention is too much in eating,

00:20:59.840 --> 00:21:04.000
especially in India, all the men
in India are very fond of good food

00:21:04.000 --> 00:21:07.440
and the women know
how to manage them.

00:21:07.440 --> 00:21:11.120
And there is such a big problem
that they will ask,

00:21:11.120 --> 00:21:13.360
What will you have morning,
what will you have evening?

00:21:13.360 --> 00:21:18.960
All the time our attention is on food.
As if that is the greatest thing

00:21:18.960 --> 00:21:21.440
that we do.
I mean, I just can’t understand.

00:21:21.440 --> 00:21:24.320
Why should there be so much
attention on food?

00:21:24.320 --> 00:21:27.840
But say, for example, in Japan,
I saw they have no attention on food.

00:21:27.840 --> 00:21:30.320
They can eat anything.
They will take raw…

00:21:31.440 --> 00:21:35.520
and eat them. Oh, but they eat everything,
four things, you see, they have no taste.

00:21:37.280 --> 00:21:39.600
But they are so much worried
about the colour scheme

00:21:39.600 --> 00:21:43.200
and about the filth around.
But Indians, that way, are not.

00:21:43.200 --> 00:21:47.760
Outside they will throw all the kachra
[waste], walk out with their nose closed

00:21:47.760 --> 00:21:50.480
and don’t mind.
As long as they had their bath,

00:21:50.480 --> 00:21:53.600
‘artha-prakashaka’ [morning bath],
finished.

00:21:53.600 --> 00:21:57.360
Then they are not bothered whether we have
collectively kept anything clean or not.

00:21:57.360 --> 00:21:59.120
Colour scheme
they are not bothered at all.

00:21:59.120 --> 00:22:01.840
Any colour they will wear,
anything they will wear.

00:22:01.840 --> 00:22:04.720
They have no sense.
Eyes are zero.

00:22:04.720 --> 00:22:09.680
But the tongue, both ways,
even talking and eating.

00:22:09.680 --> 00:22:13.680
So whatever defects we have,
we must accept that, in Sahaja Yoga,

00:22:13.680 --> 00:22:19.200
that we have such a tongue that makes
us each think too much about food.

00:22:19.200 --> 00:22:22.240
If you think
as it is too much about anything,

00:22:22.240 --> 00:22:24.240
you get a problem with your Nabhi.

00:22:24.240 --> 00:22:26.080
Now why?

00:22:26.080 --> 00:22:28.720
Around the Nabhi there is another centre

00:22:28.720 --> 00:22:32.160
which has grown out of Nabhi,
called as Swadistana.

00:22:32.160 --> 00:22:35.200
This centre is very important
in a human being, because

00:22:35.200 --> 00:22:40.480
the whole creation has been established
through this centre of Swadistana.

00:22:40.480 --> 00:22:46.400
On this resides the deity of Brahmadeva
and Sarasvati.

00:22:46.400 --> 00:22:51.280
Now when we think too much,
from where do we get those brain cells?

00:22:51.280 --> 00:22:53.920
Have you ever thought of it or the doctors
have not thought of it,

00:22:53.920 --> 00:22:55.840
from where do we get the brain cells?

00:22:55.840 --> 00:22:59.360
We get them from the fat
that is in the stomach.

00:22:59.360 --> 00:23:04.480
And when the fat is converted into
that brain cells, this poor Swadistana,

00:23:04.480 --> 00:23:10.720
which has to look after your liver,
your kidney, your pancreas, your spleen,

00:23:10.720 --> 00:23:16.400
your intestines and your also uterus,
has to do this tremendous thinking.

00:23:16.400 --> 00:23:20.560
And what do you achieve? Thinking,
thinking, thinking, thinking, like mad.

00:23:20.560 --> 00:23:24.240
And that makes it work for nothing at all,
such a wasteful habit.

00:23:24.240 --> 00:23:28.560
And the mental activity is so much that
such people will get one of the diseases.

00:23:28.560 --> 00:23:32.320
First of all, they might get liver.
Most of the Western people have livers.

00:23:32.320 --> 00:23:35.760
That’s why so thin.
They are just like mosquitoes.

00:23:35.760 --> 00:23:37.840
They are so thin,
I mean, they don’t need

00:23:37.840 --> 00:23:42.880
not have any beauty competitions,
they are already mosquitoes.

00:23:42.880 --> 00:23:46.640
And when they have these competitions
also, I’m frightened with the women

00:23:46.640 --> 00:23:50.000
that are there,
they all have horrible livers!

00:23:50.000 --> 00:23:53.680
They have horrible livers
and they are very heated up people

00:23:53.680 --> 00:23:56.240
and tensed up people,
because liver is the thing

00:23:56.240 --> 00:24:01.280
that sorts out
all our poisons in our body.

00:24:01.280 --> 00:24:07.440
If you make the liver work more
than normal, as it is, it gets spoilt.

00:24:07.440 --> 00:24:12.160
But then, on top of that, you make
it work with thinking and then you drink.

00:24:12.160 --> 00:24:18.160
Drinking will spoil the liver completely
if you are a thinker and also a drunkard.

00:24:18.160 --> 00:24:20.480
Now I do not say
that you do not drink.

00:24:20.480 --> 00:24:23.680
In Sahaja Yoga,
nothing is said before Sahaja Yoga.

00:24:23.680 --> 00:24:25.840
Before Realization, I will say,
“Come along, come along,

00:24:25.840 --> 00:24:29.360
come along, you are all right”.
I just make you come inside.

00:24:29.360 --> 00:24:33.040
“All right. You will all get Realization”.
That’s the way Mother does it, you see.

00:24:33.040 --> 00:24:34.400
“Come along, come along.
It’s all right.

00:24:34.400 --> 00:24:35.680
Doesn’t matter.
You drink, doesn’t matter.

00:24:35.680 --> 00:24:37.760
You smoke, doesn’t matter.
Whatever you do, it’s all right.

00:24:37.760 --> 00:24:40.880
You come along”.
Then raise the Kundalini.

00:24:40.880 --> 00:24:46.640
Once you raise the Kundalini,
they know that there is a problem.

00:24:46.640 --> 00:24:50.720
They know they have a liver, because
the heat starts coming from their body.

00:24:50.720 --> 00:24:52.240
Tremendous heat starts coming.

00:24:52.240 --> 00:24:54.880
If Swadistana is spoilt,
you get heat first of all.

00:24:54.880 --> 00:24:59.920
Because Swadistana Chakra
expresses all our five elements,

00:24:59.920 --> 00:25:04.560
especially the fire.
So, you start getting

00:25:04.560 --> 00:25:10.880
a feeling of heat coming out of it,
tremendous heat generated.

00:25:10.880 --> 00:25:14.960
For example, a person who suffers
from cancer emits such tremendous heat

00:25:14.960 --> 00:25:21.360
when he is exposed to Sahaja Yoga, that
you do not need any heater even in London.

00:25:21.360 --> 00:25:25.600
You have to open all the windows.
Such tremendous heat is there.

00:25:25.600 --> 00:25:29.200
Why there is heat?
Because what happens in the liver?

00:25:29.200 --> 00:25:33.040
That when it gets affected,
sluggish, it cannot work

00:25:33.040 --> 00:25:41.200
out the sorting out of the poisons.
Because when it sorts out of poisons,

00:25:41.200 --> 00:25:44.960
it gives out this thing as heat,
as carbon dioxide as heat.

00:25:44.960 --> 00:25:50.720
And the heat has to go to the water,
which is, as you know, is H2O.

00:25:50.720 --> 00:25:55.440
But when you drink and when you think
too much, when the liver is not all right,

00:25:55.440 --> 00:25:59.120
then this H2O,
the formation of H2O becomes like this,

00:25:59.120 --> 00:26:05.120
and the liver is here.
The O is here and H here.

00:26:05.120 --> 00:26:10.400
It cannot get inside
that poison or that heat.

00:26:10.400 --> 00:26:13.760
Normally, this is neutral position.
But with vibrations

00:26:13.760 --> 00:26:18.640
and with Sahaja Yoga it becomes like that.
So, the heat is carried away

00:26:18.640 --> 00:26:23.120
and you start getting the heat out
of the body coming out when you drink.

00:26:23.680 --> 00:26:27.120
Same thing can happen with a thing
like leukaemia.

00:26:27.120 --> 00:26:30.480
Now how leukaemia has caused?
Just now the gentleman who came at my feet

00:26:30.480 --> 00:26:34.400
was a very serious patient of leukaemia.
And the doctors had said that,

00:26:34.400 --> 00:26:36.400
“Within eight days,
he is going to collapse and die”.

00:26:36.400 --> 00:26:38.160
And today you see
he is perfectly all right.

00:26:38.160 --> 00:26:41.040
He came and told Me that,
“They said everything is clear”.

00:26:41.040 --> 00:26:45.760
Now how? What happens when you get cancer
and leukaemia through this Swadistana?

00:26:45.760 --> 00:26:49.040
I mean every centre can give you, but
specially Swadistana is very important.

00:26:49.040 --> 00:26:53.520
For example, we are very busy people.
We have no time for anything.

00:26:53.520 --> 00:26:58.560
When we eat our food, you know
that the spleen is producing new cells,

00:26:58.560 --> 00:27:01.680
blood cells.
That time we must settle down.

00:27:01.680 --> 00:27:04.640
In India, the custom was husband
used to sit on the path,

00:27:04.640 --> 00:27:08.160
eat the food and the wife used to fan
and the food was served

00:27:08.160 --> 00:27:12.000
and there used to be very slow tempo
for food and man woold eat.

00:27:12.000 --> 00:27:14.880
Now the news will be on,
the TV will be on,

00:27:14.880 --> 00:27:18.640
some horrible news coming at the time
when you are eating or while before eating

00:27:18.640 --> 00:27:20.720
you have decided that you have to leave
within five minutes,

00:27:20.720 --> 00:27:26.160
you just gulp down something and run out.
Immediately your spleen gets affected.

00:27:26.160 --> 00:27:29.680
The spleen has to then suddenly
produce all the emergency.

00:27:29.680 --> 00:27:32.080
How does the spleen produce the emergency?

00:27:32.080 --> 00:27:35.120
By creating more blood cells
and more blood cells.

00:27:35.120 --> 00:27:38.640
Now these blood cells,
once in a while is all right,

00:27:38.640 --> 00:27:41.520
but all the time you have to produce now
and then and then.

00:27:41.520 --> 00:27:45.280
What it is to do?
Its attention gets absolutely disturbed.

00:27:45.280 --> 00:27:49.120
And the attention is so disturbed
that it becomes crazy.

00:27:49.120 --> 00:27:52.080
When it becomes crazy it does not know
what to produce, what not to produce.

00:27:52.080 --> 00:27:53.520
It’s in a crazy state.

00:27:53.520 --> 00:27:57.360
When it is in the crazy state,
now the doctors have accepted this,

00:27:57.360 --> 00:28:02.960
that there is an attack from the areas
which are built within us

00:28:02.960 --> 00:28:07.120
by some proteins, they call it protein 58
or 62 or something, names like that,

00:28:07.120 --> 00:28:12.800
which I call as ‘bhoota badha’.
These dead souls which are within us,

00:28:12.800 --> 00:28:16.400
in our left side or right side extremes,
they exist and they attack.

00:28:16.400 --> 00:28:19.440
And once they attack,
you get this problem, they trigger.

00:28:19.440 --> 00:28:21.920
And it is said now,
now they have accepted, thank God.

00:28:21.920 --> 00:28:24.400
But they don’t know,
they say ‘unknown areas within us’.

00:28:24.400 --> 00:28:26.640
Now what are these unknown areas are?

00:28:26.640 --> 00:28:31.520
On the left-hand side, it is the area
of the collective sub-conscious,

00:28:31.520 --> 00:28:35.680
whatever is dead all over the world,
everywhere within us.

00:28:35.680 --> 00:28:40.640
And on the right-hand side
is the collective supra-conscious,

00:28:40.640 --> 00:28:43.520
where the things
from the future side come.

00:28:43.520 --> 00:28:47.280
These supra-conscious booths
are of different types.

00:28:47.280 --> 00:28:52.080
They come in, you see, you have heard
the name of Gauguin, a great painter.

00:28:52.080 --> 00:28:55.040
And this painter,
when he died, he was mad.

00:28:55.040 --> 00:28:59.200
He entered into the body of one man and
he started painting all kinds of things.

00:28:59.200 --> 00:29:02.000
They showed it on the BBC,
television, you could see clearly

00:29:02.000 --> 00:29:05.920
that he was painting just like Gauguin!
If you know his painting, how he,

00:29:05.920 --> 00:29:08.880
in one line he puts many colours,
he was doing the same thing.

00:29:08.880 --> 00:29:11.920
And he said, “I am Gauguin
who is doing it”.

00:29:11.920 --> 00:29:14.640
People suddenly become playing pianos
or something,

00:29:14.640 --> 00:29:17.320
they become geniuses
and this and that by these possessions.

00:29:17.320 --> 00:29:21.520
It’s a fact, they exist,
whether you like it or not.

00:29:21.520 --> 00:29:24.720
What these fake gurus do?
They put these booths

00:29:24.720 --> 00:29:28.080
into you and mesmerise
you and use you for their purpose,

00:29:28.080 --> 00:29:32.160
take out all your money,
empty your purses, and go ahead.

00:29:32.160 --> 00:29:36.000
Then gather more disciples.
Then gather more disciples.

00:29:36.000 --> 00:29:40.240
So, these two areas exist within us
as collective subconscious

00:29:40.240 --> 00:29:43.760
and collective supra-conscious areas.
Now in Sahaja Yoga,

00:29:43.760 --> 00:29:48.800
you have to see everything very clearly
and to understand it just like science.

00:29:48.800 --> 00:29:50.640
You are not to say, “No, no,
Mother, we don’t believe it”.

00:29:50.640 --> 00:29:52.720
You believe it or not, it is so.

00:29:52.720 --> 00:29:56.720
It is for you to see within
yourself all these things exist.

00:29:56.720 --> 00:30:01.440
So, the growth of this Brahma nadhi,
the rising of the Kundalini in the centre,

00:30:01.440 --> 00:30:04.240
which is the Brahma power,
which is the power

00:30:04.240 --> 00:30:09.920
which is all these powers put together,
is a very delicate issue.

00:30:09.920 --> 00:30:13.360
As the people have said, told you,
it’s a ‘sukshma’ [subtle],

00:30:13.360 --> 00:30:17.040
it’s a sukshma thing.
And for maintaining this sukshma

00:30:17.040 --> 00:30:20.640
within us, flowing all the time,
we have to work it out.

00:30:20.640 --> 00:30:24.640
There is a spiritual education
after Sahaja Yoga, not before,

00:30:24.640 --> 00:30:28.880
but after that you have to understand
what is what, what are the centres,

00:30:28.880 --> 00:30:32.960
how it flows, where it goes.
It is not too much of intellectualism,

00:30:32.960 --> 00:30:35.040
nothing. It is a fact.
You’ll be amazed,

00:30:35.040 --> 00:30:38.640
even children of five, six years
know it better than many grown-ups.

00:30:38.640 --> 00:30:43.600
And people from the villages know it much
better than our Western people or,

00:30:43.600 --> 00:30:46.640
say, the people
who are Westernized in the city.

00:30:46.640 --> 00:30:52.160
The reason is, they are so simple that
it becomes an actualization within them.

00:30:52.160 --> 00:30:56.560
They feel it within themselves.
And they are so sensitive that as soon

00:30:56.560 --> 00:30:59.120
as something happens, they’ll say,
“Mother, he’s caught up on this.

00:30:59.120 --> 00:31:04.480
He’s got this problem”. But a man
who is so much used to machinery,

00:31:04.480 --> 00:31:08.240
who has become more machine-like,
all the time watching the time, what time,

00:31:08.240 --> 00:31:14.800
this time, that time, such a man becomes
insensitive to the sukshma, to the subtle.

00:31:14.800 --> 00:31:19.440
And that’s why there is a problem.
So, for people who are like that,

00:31:19.440 --> 00:31:23.360
they have to develop that ‘sukshmata’,
that subtlety within them.

00:31:23.360 --> 00:31:26.160
For that, they have to pay
full attention to themselves

00:31:26.160 --> 00:31:31.040
and full respect to themselves.
This Swadishtan chakra is very important

00:31:31.040 --> 00:31:34.880
for all city dwellers.
And I personally think that I have come

00:31:34.880 --> 00:31:39.280
across most of the patients
are suffering from mostly Swadistana.

00:31:39.280 --> 00:31:42.560
Now in this, the Left Swadistana
is when it goes to the left side,

00:31:42.560 --> 00:31:45.440
when the catch is on the left side,
you feel it here.

00:31:46.560 --> 00:31:48.640
This comes
if you have been to a wrong guru,

00:31:48.640 --> 00:31:54.400
to an unauthorized person, if you have put
this forehead before any such person.

00:31:54.400 --> 00:31:56.160
If you have been doing some sort of…

00:31:56.160 --> 00:31:58.320
because people will say,
“I am meditating”.

00:31:58.320 --> 00:32:02.800
Now how do you meditate?
You become in meditation.

00:32:02.800 --> 00:32:07.200
You cannot meditate:
you become meditative. It’s a becoming.

00:32:07.200 --> 00:32:10.240
It is not just, “I am meditating”,
how you sit down like this, you meditate.

00:32:10.240 --> 00:32:13.520
Is your attention inside?
The attention is outside.

00:32:13.520 --> 00:32:16.800
Unnecessarily you are saying,
“I am meditating”.

00:32:16.800 --> 00:32:20.160
Most of these people who give you names
also, take this name and take.

00:32:20.160 --> 00:32:25.040
One guru who took three hundred pounds
gave a name to these poor foreigners.

00:32:25.040 --> 00:32:30.000
You won’t believe as ‘Thinga’ and ‘Inga’.
Can you believe it?

00:32:30.000 --> 00:32:32.080
And these people paid
three hundred pounds.

00:32:32.080 --> 00:32:34.720
And this fellow has,
is now very nicely…

00:32:34.720 --> 00:32:38.160
I recently read a big article
he wrote about Vedas and this,

00:32:38.160 --> 00:32:41.760
and they are identifying themselves
as Veda.

00:32:41.760 --> 00:32:46.400
But at least thank God Indians understand
that Inga and Thinga cannot be a mantra.

00:32:46.400 --> 00:32:50.000
And these things
then start working on the Left Swadistana.

00:32:50.000 --> 00:32:54.880
And you can feel the Left Swadistana
so clearly that this person has been

00:32:54.880 --> 00:32:58.400
doing something which is unauthorized.
He may deny, he may defy.

00:32:58.400 --> 00:33:03.920
Even if you have one book in the house,
a photograph of one of these rakshasas

00:33:03.920 --> 00:33:07.120
with you, you catch with it.
It’s so simple.

00:33:07.120 --> 00:33:09.920
Even a small child can say,
“You are catching on left Swadistana”.

00:33:09.920 --> 00:33:12.160
Now I would request
that other day the gentleman

00:33:12.160 --> 00:33:14.720
was talking of some other guru
and this and that.

00:33:14.720 --> 00:33:18.960
I have to tell you one thing: you must see
your swartha [your Self], swa-artha.

00:33:18.960 --> 00:33:23.120
You must get your Realization.
Why are you identified with these gurus?

00:33:23.120 --> 00:33:32.771
Have they given you their ‘vakalatnama’
[document granting authority to a lawyer]?

00:33:32.771 --> 00:33:32.799
Are you their pleaders here?

00:33:32.799 --> 00:33:32.841
Are they paying
you or you are paying them?

00:33:32.841 --> 00:33:34.400
Why should you be identified
with these people who are just trying

00:33:34.400 --> 00:33:38.800
to toy you and pull you around?
What have they given you?

00:33:38.800 --> 00:33:43.440
Have they given you your powers?
So, as good children you must understand,

00:33:43.440 --> 00:33:46.480
I am your Mother and I am going
to tell you whatever is the truth.

00:33:46.480 --> 00:33:49.840
And if you are interested in such
horrible people, go ahead with them,

00:33:49.840 --> 00:33:53.360
and spoil your life and spoil the lives
of your children, and go ahead.

00:33:53.360 --> 00:33:57.120
But don’t come to Me again
when you get into problems.

00:33:57.120 --> 00:34:01.520
You must know your ‘swartha’.
You must get your Realization.

00:34:01.520 --> 00:34:04.960
You must get your own powers.
You must know what you are.

00:34:04.960 --> 00:34:08.400
That’s why you are here
and you are here on this earth.

00:34:08.400 --> 00:34:11.520
You are made from amoeba to human beings
for this purpose to know

00:34:11.520 --> 00:34:16.320
who you are and not to support some guru
or somebody blindly.

00:34:16.320 --> 00:34:24.080
Because some guru has said, somebody calls
himself Swamiji… Some of them deserve…

00:34:24.080 --> 00:34:26.320
You do not know
how terrible these people are and I am

00:34:26.320 --> 00:34:28.320
going to take all of them to task.

00:34:28.320 --> 00:34:33.760
In 1970, I have told everyone by names,
all the names of these horrible people!

00:34:33.760 --> 00:34:38.080
But still people are more enamoured
by them and going to them.

00:34:38.080 --> 00:34:42.160
So, if you are going to anyone of such
horrible people, you need to give up.

00:34:42.160 --> 00:34:44.560
You must get your powers.
You must know

00:34:44.560 --> 00:34:49.200
who you are and you must know
that this is your right to get it.

00:34:49.200 --> 00:34:52.480
You must have it.
This is the time that has come.

00:34:52.480 --> 00:34:57.200
So, do not get identified with any Dick,
Tom and Harry.

00:34:57.200 --> 00:35:01.600
They are, as in Marathi said,…
In every doorstep, you will find them

00:35:01.600 --> 00:35:07.840
sitting down with some sort of a big board
wearing a ‘kashaya’ [robe worn by monks].

00:35:07.840 --> 00:35:10.080
What is the need to wear kashaya?

00:35:10.080 --> 00:35:13.200
What is there to?
And now that you are a sanyasi,

00:35:13.200 --> 00:35:17.280
if you are a sanyasi,
you are sanyasi within.

00:35:17.280 --> 00:35:21.920
There’s a very nice story about Janaka
who was a king, who lived like a king.

00:35:21.920 --> 00:35:27.600
Say, if supposing, if I was a poor woman,
I would have lived on the streets.

00:35:27.600 --> 00:35:30.720
I can even today. I can.
Every time you ask Me,

00:35:30.720 --> 00:35:34.080
I go to the villages, no bathrooms,
nothing. It makes no difference to Me.

00:35:34.080 --> 00:35:37.200
Now, you see, maybe
that I come from a rich family,

00:35:37.200 --> 00:35:41.920
my husband is rich, so whatever
it is there makes no difference to Me.

00:35:41.920 --> 00:35:44.800
I do not need anything.
A person who is really a ‘baccha’

00:35:44.800 --> 00:35:47.680
[young] doesn’t need anything.
He can sit on the street.

00:35:47.680 --> 00:35:50.800
He has no problem
of his personal comforts.

00:35:50.800 --> 00:35:53.360
He will never talk
of his personal comforts.

00:35:53.360 --> 00:35:57.520
That is the sign of a personality.
But these must have ‘sambhi

00:35:57.520 --> 00:36:01.120
Sambandha’ [unsure].
What is ‘sandhya’ and…

00:36:01.120 --> 00:36:06.000
diamonds or anything to such a person?
It’s equal to the dust!

00:36:06.000 --> 00:36:09.840
One must understand
the value of spirituality.

00:36:09.840 --> 00:36:13.520
Spirituality takes you away from all
these things and you are above it.

00:36:13.520 --> 00:36:16.160
And the beautiful story
of Janaka is that he was called

00:36:16.160 --> 00:36:17.680
as ‘videhi’ [spiritually detached].

00:36:17.680 --> 00:36:24.320
And Narada went and asked him,
“Why are you called videhi?

00:36:24.320 --> 00:36:30.240
You have got everything and you live
in luxury and you are called as videhi?

00:36:30.240 --> 00:36:32.880
How is it?”
He said, “very simple”.

00:36:32.880 --> 00:36:37.200
He said, “Videhi has to have his
all attention on his Spirit”.

00:36:37.200 --> 00:36:40.880
He said, “Yes, it is true”.
So, he said, “How do you manage it?

00:36:40.880 --> 00:36:42.640
“It’s very simple, he said,
all right, I’ll tell

00:36:42.640 --> 00:36:46.320
you in the evening the secret of it.
But today I give you a bowl,

00:36:46.320 --> 00:36:52.640
a ‘katora’ of milk, you carry it with you.
And do not allow anything to spill out.

00:36:52.640 --> 00:36:59.120
Carry it.
And not a drop of it should fall down”.

00:36:59.120 --> 00:37:03.360
And the whole day, there was a procession,
this, that, and a big dance.

00:37:03.360 --> 00:37:05.440
The people came
and danced before him.

00:37:05.440 --> 00:37:09.120
The villagers came and then then
there was also coronation, this, that.

00:37:09.120 --> 00:37:12.000
All the things
that are done to a king were done.

00:37:12.000 --> 00:37:16.080
And in the evening, Narada said,
“Now, please tell me the secret”.

00:37:16.080 --> 00:37:18.800
He said, “What did you see the whole day?”
He said, “What?

00:37:18.800 --> 00:37:20.720
I didn’t see anything.
How could I see?

00:37:20.720 --> 00:37:23.920
You had told me
that I should look after this katora,

00:37:23.920 --> 00:37:27.200
and there should not be any spilling
of a single drop.

00:37:27.200 --> 00:37:32.320
How can I do it?
If I were to do these things,

00:37:32.320 --> 00:37:37.440
of spilling of milk and all that,
then I could have seen.

00:37:37.440 --> 00:37:40.560
But I was not allowed.
So, what am I to do?

00:37:40.560 --> 00:37:42.560
I never saw anything.
I never felt anything.

00:37:42.560 --> 00:37:45.680
I was just looking at the katora”.
He said, “In the same way,

00:37:45.680 --> 00:37:50.720
all the time I look at my Spirit.
I look through my Spirit.

00:37:50.720 --> 00:37:56.560
My attention is not allowed to spill out,
even this way”.

00:37:56.560 --> 00:38:01.280
So, all such falsehood
and all such nonsense of showing off that,

00:38:01.280 --> 00:38:06.720
“I am a sanyasi baba, I am this thing and
that thing”, is not needed in Sahaja Yoga.

00:38:06.720 --> 00:38:11.840
Not to shout or scream,
but to achieve it within yourself.

00:38:11.840 --> 00:38:13.840
If I tell you that,
“Believe this is the diamond”.

00:38:13.840 --> 00:38:18.640
Will you believe it?
In the same way, in Realization also,

00:38:18.640 --> 00:38:22.720
you must ask for the truth,
and not for just a certificate that,

00:38:22.720 --> 00:38:27.840
“Oh, now we have got Realization” and “Oh,
we have got our Kundalini awakened”.

00:38:27.840 --> 00:38:32.160
No, do not be satisfied with that.
You cannot be satisfied with falsehood.

00:38:32.160 --> 00:38:36.880
Can you be? If I give you a false state,
will you be satisfied with that?

00:38:36.880 --> 00:38:41.120
You have to have the truthful thing.
And those who are wanting that,

00:38:41.120 --> 00:38:44.800
can only stay in Sahaja Yoga
and not the people who just want pampering

00:38:44.800 --> 00:38:48.560
and say, “Oh, you are great sadhus
and you are this and you are great people

00:38:48.560 --> 00:38:53.120
and you give me your purse
and you’ll be all right”.

00:38:53.120 --> 00:38:55.440
All such things cannot
work out in Sahaja Yoga.

00:38:55.440 --> 00:38:59.680
That’s why for all people who are here,
I would request that be careful

00:38:59.680 --> 00:39:03.520
about your Swadistana chakra.
Swadistana has been the problem yesterday

00:39:03.520 --> 00:39:06.320
and today also,
because you people think too much.

00:39:06.320 --> 00:39:08.800
What is the solution?
What is the mantra?

00:39:08.800 --> 00:39:13.920
To get your Swadistana, it’s very simple
as I told you yesterday, forgive everyone.

00:39:13.920 --> 00:39:16.000
You just say,
“I forgive everyone”

00:39:16.000 --> 00:39:18.720
and you’ll be amazed,
your thinking will stop after Realization.

00:39:18.720 --> 00:39:23.280
It’s a very simple mantra saying,
“Mother, I forgive everyone”.

00:39:23.280 --> 00:39:26.080
If you start now only saying that,
“Mother, I forgive everyone”,

00:39:26.080 --> 00:39:32.160
you’ll be surprised, your thoughtless
awareness will be immediately established.

00:39:32.160 --> 00:39:35.600
Now, from there we go.…

00:39:36.560 --> 00:39:39.600
There are other chakras of heart
which I think I should tell

00:39:39.600 --> 00:39:45.760
you because heart itself, the organ,
has the Spirit, which is sat-chit-ananda.

00:39:45.760 --> 00:39:50.560
The Spirit enjoys itself.
It doesn’t need any outward enjoyment.

00:39:50.560 --> 00:39:55.600
It’s the flicker of its own.
It doesn’t need any help or anything.

00:39:55.600 --> 00:39:57.520
It is the one which is the kshetragya
[the knower of the field],

00:39:57.520 --> 00:39:59.760
which is watching you, what you are doing.
It is just watching.

00:39:59.760 --> 00:40:03.520
And when it sees you are going too much,
it flickers out. For example,

00:40:03.520 --> 00:40:08.400
a person who is too much worried
about his body always gets a heart attack.

00:40:08.400 --> 00:40:12.400
A person who thinks too much also gets
a heart attack because of imbalances.

00:40:12.400 --> 00:40:15.600
The one who is so much
worried gets a heart attack.

00:40:15.600 --> 00:40:19.120
Surprising. You see,
the heart has to do emotional work.

00:40:19.120 --> 00:40:21.120
The heart does the emotional work.

00:40:21.120 --> 00:40:24.000
But those who are emotionally disturbed,
never get a heart attack.

00:40:24.000 --> 00:40:27.040
For example,
mad people will never get a heart attack.

00:40:27.040 --> 00:40:31.680
Those who are mad people will never get a
heart attack, they will never be a heart…

00:40:31.680 --> 00:40:34.800
even the heart instrument is not needed
for mad people.

00:40:34.800 --> 00:40:39.600
But a person who is doing too much
mental thing gets a heart attack.

00:40:39.600 --> 00:40:43.040
Because he is working too much
on the right-hand side, creating too much

00:40:43.040 --> 00:40:48.480
and neglecting his left side because
of imbalances, he gets his heart attack.

00:40:48.480 --> 00:40:52.240
Actually, the persons
who are weak in heart should know

00:40:52.240 --> 00:40:54.400
that they have to give
a balance to their life.

00:40:54.400 --> 00:40:57.280
They have to love more.
They have to think less.

00:40:57.280 --> 00:41:02.080
They have to pay more attention to their
‘manna’ and less attention to their ego.

00:41:02.080 --> 00:41:05.360
When the ego expands
with this right-side activity,

00:41:05.360 --> 00:41:08.560
it actually clutches the heart sometimes.
And a person doesn’t see

00:41:08.560 --> 00:41:11.760
that he is egoistical.
He is so blind, he cannot see.

00:41:11.760 --> 00:41:14.640
He thinks, “I am doing national work,
I am doing this work,

00:41:14.640 --> 00:41:18.160
I am doing that work”.
First is that you look after yourself.

00:41:18.160 --> 00:41:20.800
As a mother I would say,
once you are all right,

00:41:20.800 --> 00:41:25.680
once all of you are all right,
once you become Sahaja Yogis, your country

00:41:25.680 --> 00:41:28.800
will become the most beautiful Nandan
[paradise] one in the whole world.

00:41:28.800 --> 00:41:31.760
That day is not far.
I can see that very clearly.

00:41:31.760 --> 00:41:35.200
The time has come for India to lead
the whole world in spirituality.

00:41:35.200 --> 00:41:37.600
We are not going to lead them
in all nonsensical things.

00:41:37.600 --> 00:41:41.600
So, give up all these nonsensical
activities of yours, where you are wasting

00:41:41.600 --> 00:41:44.400
and frittering away your time.
Take to God.

00:41:44.400 --> 00:41:50.560
Take to your Spirit.
Arise, awaken and live it.

00:41:50.560 --> 00:41:53.200
This is the most important thing,
is your Spirit.

00:41:53.200 --> 00:41:54.800
Achieve it.
That’s your power.

00:41:54.800 --> 00:41:57.600
That’s the Brahmacharya.
Achieve it and you’ll be amazed.

00:41:57.600 --> 00:42:00.640
All the Chiranjivas
and all the angels will look after you.

00:42:00.640 --> 00:42:03.120
The whole country,
the entire thing will be changed.

00:42:03.120 --> 00:42:05.920
You all will be changed.
It’s a different thing.

00:42:05.920 --> 00:42:08.880
This transformation has to take place.
That’s only possible

00:42:08.880 --> 00:42:13.920
when this flicker of your ‘atma’ comes
into your attention and enlightens you.

00:42:13.920 --> 00:42:15.120
May God bless you all.

00:42:15.120 --> 00:42:17.120
I’m sure today we’ll work it out again.

00:42:17.120 --> 00:42:20.960
There’s a very good book
written by a Frenchman.

00:42:20.960 --> 00:42:25.200
He’s actually French, but he lives
in Switzerland, so he’s a Swiss-French.

00:42:25.200 --> 00:42:27.840
And he has gone thoroughly
into Sahaja Yoga.

00:42:27.840 --> 00:42:31.280
He’s a great seeker and he has written
a very nice book called as Advent.

00:42:31.280 --> 00:42:33.440
Those who are interested
can purchase the book.

00:42:33.440 --> 00:42:37.920
We have just put the price, minimum
of minimum, that is required for printing.

00:42:37.920 --> 00:42:43.520
And the book is outside.
Maybe I think we have Advent here?

00:42:43.520 --> 00:42:46.080
And you can buy
that book if you want.

00:42:46.080 --> 00:42:49.840
And you please,
now today being the last day in Bombay,

00:42:49.840 --> 00:42:52.720
I have to tell you a few things
as to how to go further.

00:42:52.720 --> 00:42:54.640
You will get your Realization
most of you today.

00:42:54.640 --> 00:42:58.320
You must have got it already, no doubt.
But this is, I’m telling you,

00:42:58.320 --> 00:43:00.640
is very subtle,
and the beginning has started.

00:43:00.640 --> 00:43:03.360
The Kundalini has risen,
pierced the thing.

00:43:03.360 --> 00:43:09.680
But it is through a very,
very small thread-like channel,

00:43:09.680 --> 00:43:12.800
called as Brahmandri,
the Kundalini has been taken.

00:43:12.800 --> 00:43:15.200
I know that.
It has gone through a very,

00:43:15.200 --> 00:43:19.360
very thin, subtle nadi called
as Brahma nadi and has pierced.

00:43:19.360 --> 00:43:24.880
By piercing, you see, the first
is pierced, by which you start the power.

00:43:24.880 --> 00:43:27.920
The power starts.
But it is to be established.

00:43:27.920 --> 00:43:30.640
And the establishment
has to be done properly.

00:43:30.640 --> 00:43:33.280
Now, if you buy the book
and there is a photograph

00:43:33.280 --> 00:43:37.360
which is at a minimum price, because
we don’t have to make money out of it,

00:43:37.360 --> 00:43:39.120
but you must pay at least
for a photograph.

00:43:39.120 --> 00:43:41.680
You shouldn’t also expect,
you shouldn’t be also parasites.

00:43:41.680 --> 00:43:44.480
So, it works out both ways.
Take the photograph,

00:43:44.480 --> 00:43:49.120
put it properly, with respect,
and work it out for seven days minimum.

00:43:49.120 --> 00:43:54.880
We have centres in Bombay.
We have a centre in, say, Gita Mandir.

00:43:54.880 --> 00:43:56.240
Hum?

00:43:56.240 --> 00:44:03.440
… Bhagavan, in the Gita hall.
What’s day?

00:44:03.440 --> 00:44:05.498
Tuesday.

00:44:05.498 --> 00:44:05.520
Tuesday?
Tuesday, 6.30.

00:44:05.520 --> 00:44:08.560
Tuesday, 6.30.
It’s very near for people

00:44:08.560 --> 00:44:12.160
who live in Kolama.
Then we have one……

00:44:14.000 --> 00:44:14.948
Sane Guruji Hall.

00:44:14.948 --> 00:44:17.120
Sane Guruji Hall. In Sane Guruji
Hall Dadar, we have another centre.

00:44:17.120 --> 00:44:20.320
You can get some telephone numbers
where you can find out also.

00:44:20.320 --> 00:44:22.400
You can give them few numbers
which are given.

00:44:22.400 --> 00:44:24.880
There are phones here.
You can take it down.

00:44:24.880 --> 00:44:27.280
And be careful about what you have got.

00:44:27.280 --> 00:44:30.720
It’s the most precious thing
which you have been seeking for ages now.

00:44:30.720 --> 00:44:34.000
Not in this life, but in many lives.
This is your ‘sukrit’ [good deeds].

00:44:34.000 --> 00:44:35.840
This is what you have achieved
in your last life.

00:44:35.840 --> 00:44:39.200
You don’t know your depths.
You have to touch them. The depth exists.

00:44:39.200 --> 00:44:41.120
If there was no depth,
you would not be here.

00:44:41.120 --> 00:44:43.120
The depth is there,
but you have to touch it.

00:44:43.120 --> 00:44:46.960
And you must touch it in these seven days.
It’s very, very crucial.

00:44:46.960 --> 00:44:54.800
I think we will have a program now,…
next Tuesday, in… Repeat it then.

00:44:54.800 --> 00:44:57.840
You see, this is one day
if you have to spend for yourself,

00:44:57.840 --> 00:45:01.840
you don’t have to do anything else.
Just come there and learn about it.

00:45:01.840 --> 00:45:07.040
It is very important
that you must learn how to maintain,

00:45:07.040 --> 00:45:10.480
how to keep your vibrations all right,
and how to be there.

00:45:10.480 --> 00:45:13.920
Because to raise the Kundalini
is very easy, is a ‘lila’ for Me.

00:45:13.920 --> 00:45:16.560
It’s the simplest thing
for Me, it can be done.

00:45:16.560 --> 00:45:20.960
But to maintain it is your job.
Before that, no effort is needed.

00:45:20.960 --> 00:45:23.840
Nothing is needed.
But after that, you have to maintain it.

00:45:23.840 --> 00:45:28.640
Like a seed,
seed sprouts in the Mother Earth.

00:45:28.640 --> 00:45:30.880
You put it there, it sprouts.
And after sprouting,

00:45:30.880 --> 00:45:33.280
you have to look after it.
In the same way,

00:45:33.280 --> 00:45:37.680
your seed, even if it is sprouted,
even the Brahmarandhra has been broken,

00:45:37.680 --> 00:45:42.080
and even the vibrations are coming,
you must know that you have to develop

00:45:42.080 --> 00:45:43.680
your ‘sadhana’ [discipline and practice].
This is one point.

00:45:43.680 --> 00:45:48.400
Second point is that Sahaja Yoga
is not an individual sadhana at all.

00:45:48.400 --> 00:45:51.800
All of you must get Realisation.
So, it’s a collective sadhana.

00:45:51.800 --> 00:45:58.560
So, I gave them a story which we all know,
that some birds were caught up in a net.

00:45:58.560 --> 00:46:00.720
And they wanted to get rid of that.

00:46:00.720 --> 00:46:03.760
So, they decided that,
“All of us should fly together

00:46:03.760 --> 00:46:06.720
so the whole net can go with us,
and then we’ll cut it off”.

00:46:06.720 --> 00:46:09.280
In the same way,
all of us have to take the flight.

00:46:09.280 --> 00:46:12.400
It’s not that one person will sit at home
and say, “Mother,

00:46:12.400 --> 00:46:14.000
I’ve been worshipping you”.
There are people

00:46:14.000 --> 00:46:17.440
who have been sitting for years together,
and their vibrations never came back.

00:46:17.440 --> 00:46:20.720
But as soon as you start giving
it to others, it works out.

00:46:20.720 --> 00:46:23.200
When you come to the collectivity,
it works out.

00:46:23.200 --> 00:46:26.480
It is, why should a light be enlightened
if you are not going to give

00:46:26.480 --> 00:46:30.720
light to others? As I told you yesterday,
you must know it’s a collective happening.

00:46:30.720 --> 00:46:32.720
And you become a collective
conscious mind.

00:46:32.720 --> 00:46:34.960
You become again and again.
I say, you become.

00:46:34.960 --> 00:46:40.240
It is not any lecturing, but you become.
And on your hands, you start feeling it.

00:46:40.240 --> 00:46:45.200
Now, no questions, because yesterday’s
questions were really stupid and useless.

00:46:45.200 --> 00:46:48.400
And they wasted everybody’s time,
and some people lost their chances

00:46:48.400 --> 00:46:51.360
of Realization.
So, no questions.

00:46:51.360 --> 00:46:54.040
You must talk uninterrupted
fifteen minutes.

00:46:54.040 --> 00:46:54.400
Hum?

00:46:54.400 --> 00:46:56.720
You must talk uninterrupted
fifteen minutes

00:46:56.720 --> 00:47:02.870
because they are going to photograph you.

00:47:02.870 --> 00:47:02.880
All right.

00:47:02.880 --> 00:47:06.240
Please be seated.
Now, first of all,

00:47:06.240 --> 00:47:10.160
we must understand that these centres
are present in all of us.

00:47:10.160 --> 00:47:13.840
It is not only
that it is present in X or Y.

00:47:13.840 --> 00:47:18.720
It is not that somebody has bad or good.
Everybody has some problem,

00:47:18.720 --> 00:47:22.080
something in the centre.
So, it does not matter.

00:47:22.080 --> 00:47:26.000
If X has one centre wrong,
or another has another centre wrong,

00:47:26.000 --> 00:47:28.480
doesn’t matter.
Kundalini shoots off.

00:47:28.480 --> 00:47:33.280
She is like a jet in modern times.
And you cannot stop it sometimes.

00:47:33.280 --> 00:47:38.080
But sometimes it stops because
if the chakra is not all right, it stops.

00:47:38.080 --> 00:47:44.400
Sometimes few threads are up there, but
the full force of Kundalini is not there.

00:47:44.400 --> 00:47:46.400
The force of Kundalini,
to maintain it,

00:47:46.400 --> 00:47:49.840
you must know
that it is the desire of a seeker.

00:47:49.840 --> 00:47:53.440
It’s the earnest desire from his heart,
keeps the force going.

00:47:53.440 --> 00:47:56.880
If you do not have the desire,
you will not have your Mahakali Shakti.

00:47:56.880 --> 00:48:01.040
And this Kundalini Shakti is actually
the residual Mahakali Shakti, means

00:48:01.040 --> 00:48:04.640
that this Kundalini produces the whole
‘pindha’ [mass], the whole thing.

00:48:04.640 --> 00:48:09.360
And after that, whatever is remained
means the whole of it is the Kundalini.

00:48:09.360 --> 00:48:11.760
So, in your desire,
if you are lacking,

00:48:11.760 --> 00:48:18.080
people have no desire
to have the Spirit acting in them,

00:48:18.080 --> 00:48:23.440
the “atma” manifesting itself,
God is not going to fall at your feet.

00:48:23.440 --> 00:48:26.160
He is not going to fall;
you have to ask for it.

00:48:26.160 --> 00:48:30.720
You have to ask that,
“Let my Realization work it out.

00:48:30.720 --> 00:48:38.720
Let my Realization achieve it.
Let me establish myself”.

00:48:38.720 --> 00:48:43.120
But gradually when you start moving in it,
you see the transformation is so quick

00:48:43.120 --> 00:48:47.280
and so dynamic and so magical
that you are surprised.

00:48:47.280 --> 00:48:51.760
We had somebody in Paris who came to Me
and he was suffering from lots of troubles

00:48:51.760 --> 00:48:53.680
and he has been to many gurus
and this and that.

00:48:53.680 --> 00:48:56.800
He was quite misidentified.
But when I told him

00:48:56.800 --> 00:49:00.240
that how to do the Kundalini awakening
and all that and how to keep it on,

00:49:00.240 --> 00:49:03.840
within 15 days he was a transformed man.
All his health was all right.

00:49:03.840 --> 00:49:05.920
He was perfect.
His face was all right.

00:49:05.920 --> 00:49:10.400
And all the twitching and all the nervous
troubles he had was gone.

00:49:10.400 --> 00:49:14.480
And he had an eye which used to twitch.
He had a face which used to twitch.

00:49:14.480 --> 00:49:16.720
Everything stopped.
All nervousness stopped.

00:49:16.720 --> 00:49:19.680
And he became a very healthy man
and a very light-headed.

00:49:19.680 --> 00:49:22.160
And his age started showing.
He became even

00:49:22.160 --> 00:49:26.320
20 years younger than what he was.
Actually, when I saw him next time,

00:49:26.320 --> 00:49:28.880
I could not even make out
that he is the same person.

00:49:28.880 --> 00:49:31.200
He started growing hair.
I was surprised

00:49:31.200 --> 00:49:34.480
that he has started growing hair
and he is doing all these things.

00:49:34.480 --> 00:49:37.360
Because this is the Brahma Shakti,
the Shakti through

00:49:37.360 --> 00:49:40.000
which we get all our vitality,
our Prana Shakti,

00:49:40.000 --> 00:49:43.520
our Manas Shakti and our sustenance,
the Dharma Shakti.

00:49:43.520 --> 00:49:48.320
All of them come from this one Brahma
Shakti which thinks, which organizes,

00:49:48.320 --> 00:49:51.760
above all, it loves.
It’s the most dynamic thing.

00:49:51.760 --> 00:49:55.120
And the whole dynamism
of every power comes through that.

00:49:55.120 --> 00:49:57.200
All the five elements
have come through that.

00:49:57.200 --> 00:50:02.000
So, this special thing one has to know
that we are something special

00:50:02.000 --> 00:50:06.080
to get this realization within us.
Every Dick, Tom and Harry cannot get it.

00:50:06.080 --> 00:50:08.880
I can assure you this.
You will be people

00:50:08.880 --> 00:50:10.960
who will be getting in masses
and all that.

00:50:10.960 --> 00:50:14.800
But I cannot say that all the world
will get Realization. May not be.

00:50:14.800 --> 00:50:18.480
Because in evolutionary processes,
it has never happened before.

00:50:18.480 --> 00:50:20.960
One fish came out,
ten came out, twenty came out.

00:50:20.960 --> 00:50:23.920
But today there are many human
beings out of those fishes,

00:50:23.920 --> 00:50:29.280
but there are still fishes. So,
in evolution also you may not achieve it.

00:50:29.280 --> 00:50:31.440
But those who are seekers will get it.

00:50:31.440 --> 00:50:34.800
I was surprised that William Blake,
a man who was in England

00:50:34.800 --> 00:50:38.640
for about hundred years back,
has mentioned everything about Sahaja Yoga

00:50:38.640 --> 00:50:43.280
so clearly in his book ‘Milton’.
Not only that he has mentioned the place

00:50:43.280 --> 00:50:46.160
where it will start first,
because I was living in Surrey Hills.

00:50:46.160 --> 00:50:49.520
So, he says, “First beacons
will be lit in Surrey Hills”.

00:50:49.520 --> 00:50:52.560
Then he says that,
” Lambeth’s Vale will be the place,

00:50:52.560 --> 00:50:55.680
ruins, in ruins,
the foundations will be laid”.

00:50:55.680 --> 00:51:00.720
And he always used a feminine thing,
“Her, her looms will vibrate

00:51:00.720 --> 00:51:03.920
the delicate sinews of love”.
Throughout, it’s such a big book.

00:51:03.920 --> 00:51:06.080
And the whole thing
is the description of Sahaja Yoga.

00:51:06.080 --> 00:51:08.080
The best part of it he has said
hundred years back,

00:51:08.080 --> 00:51:11.680
see William Blake, that,
“London will become Jerusalem”.

00:51:11.680 --> 00:51:14.720
That it will become the kshetra.
And it’s a fact.

00:51:14.720 --> 00:51:16.880
You’ll be surprised in Algeria,
I have a disciple

00:51:16.880 --> 00:51:21.680
who is working with the Air Force
and he’s an aeronautic engineer.

00:51:21.680 --> 00:51:24.960
And his mother said, “Why don’t
you get me a ticket to go to Jeddah?”

00:51:24.960 --> 00:51:26.320
He said, “Why go to Jeddah?

00:51:26.320 --> 00:51:31.040
Now Jeddah has shifted to London.
What is the need to go there?”

00:51:31.040 --> 00:51:37.280
This was pointed out hundred years
back by a person called William Blake,

00:51:37.280 --> 00:51:41.120
who has said that, “Those
who will not follow this will go to Hell”.

00:51:41.120 --> 00:51:42.400
And he has described it.

00:51:42.400 --> 00:51:45.120
He has put all the pictures
and paintings of Hell.

00:51:45.120 --> 00:51:47.920
And also, he has said
a very remarkable thing, which is very,

00:51:47.920 --> 00:51:53.680
very true and very, very fantastic,
which people cannot explain that,

00:51:53.680 --> 00:51:58.160
“God of men, means the seekers,
will become prophets.

00:51:58.160 --> 00:52:02.640
And these prophets will create prophets”.
That’s what Sahaja Yoga is.

00:52:02.640 --> 00:52:06.000
One light which is enlightened
can enlighten another light.

00:52:06.000 --> 00:52:09.280
This is what it is. And that’s
why it’s a collective happening.

00:52:09.280 --> 00:52:11.440
You cannot take your Realization
and enjoy at home.

00:52:11.440 --> 00:52:14.000
No, you have to come
and enjoy with others.

00:52:14.000 --> 00:52:17.840
And then you will see such a great joy,
such a great joy.

00:52:17.840 --> 00:52:20.400
Because you talk the same language,
you are transforming.

00:52:20.400 --> 00:52:27.840
It’s a different growth, like the growth
of the lotus coming up over the maya,

00:52:27.840 --> 00:52:34.000
the complete filth left behind
and you are above it.

00:52:34.000 --> 00:52:35.360
And like that, you grow.

00:52:35.360 --> 00:52:37.920
And look at each other
and when the wind blows,

00:52:37.920 --> 00:52:42.640
the cool breeze is the breeze that blows.
And this is described even in the Bible,

00:52:42.640 --> 00:52:46.080
you’ll be surprised, it’s called
as the cool breeze of the Holy Ghost.

00:52:46.080 --> 00:52:51.040
And even he has described it in Milton
that, “The cool breeze will start blowing

00:52:51.040 --> 00:52:53.040
and you will start
feeling the cool breeze”.

00:52:53.040 --> 00:52:58.080
And that’s why it is quite remarkable
how these things have taken place

00:52:58.080 --> 00:53:02.400
in that country, which has nothing
to do with Spirituality much.

00:53:02.400 --> 00:53:08.560
And we should be so much grateful
that we are born in this great country,

00:53:08.560 --> 00:53:15.920
in this Maharashtra, which is really
a very great spiritual country,

00:53:15.920 --> 00:53:18.880
with great heritage.
And that you are here,

00:53:18.880 --> 00:53:21.840
even if you are not born,
you are in Maharashtra.

00:53:21.840 --> 00:53:26.160
Be thankful.
Please, use your vibrations.

00:53:26.160 --> 00:53:30.400
Don’t use this for fighting with other
people, “Go back non-Maharashtrians!”

00:53:30.400 --> 00:53:34.400
and all this nonsense.
But use this for knowing

00:53:34.400 --> 00:53:37.920
that you have come to a place
where there are saints happening.

00:53:37.920 --> 00:53:41.280
All over the world, all over the world
there have been saints that way.

00:53:41.280 --> 00:53:44.480
All over the country
also we have had great saints.

00:53:44.480 --> 00:53:47.200
We have got many Jyotirlingas all over.

00:53:47.200 --> 00:53:51.200
We have got many temples
and churches which are vibrated.

00:53:51.200 --> 00:53:56.560
I would say that Notre Dame
in Paris is a vibrated place

00:53:56.560 --> 00:53:59.440
and there are many places
which are vibrated, no doubt.

00:53:59.440 --> 00:54:01.920
But Maharashtra
has the greatest significance

00:54:01.920 --> 00:54:03.840
because there are Ashta Vinayakas.

00:54:03.840 --> 00:54:07.360
And Vinayaka’s Shakti you have:
you become like Vinayaka.

00:54:07.360 --> 00:54:10.240
As Vinayaka was created,
you are created, because

00:54:10.240 --> 00:54:15.040
this Kundalini Shakti is Vinayaka Shakti.
He raises the Kundalini with his fingers.

00:54:15.040 --> 00:54:18.800
Like that, you can also raise
your Kundalini with fingers.

00:54:18.800 --> 00:54:21.920
It is most surprising
how it has given powers to people.

00:54:21.920 --> 00:54:23.360
Like ordinary fishermen.

00:54:23.360 --> 00:54:26.240
Today a fisherman came to see Me
in the morning, and he told Me,

00:54:26.240 --> 00:54:29.600
“Mother, I didn’t know you have,
we have so many powers within ourselves”.

00:54:29.600 --> 00:54:31.200
I said, “What happened?”
He said, “You know,

00:54:31.200 --> 00:54:37.440
I was going to see my brother-in-law
and I wanted to cure him with Sahaja Yoga,

00:54:37.440 --> 00:54:40.880
and it was raining so much
that I could not take my boat across.

00:54:40.880 --> 00:54:43.600
So, I told the rain,
I said, ‘Now you will stop

00:54:43.600 --> 00:54:48.000
it in the name of my Mother,
and the power that I have through Her.

00:54:48.000 --> 00:54:50.800
Will you stop that?”
And it just stopped immediately!

00:54:50.800 --> 00:54:53.120
‘Until I come back
you are not going to misbehave’”.

00:54:53.120 --> 00:54:55.680
And like a child he was telling it.
And he said, “It did not come.

00:54:55.680 --> 00:54:57.440
I cured the fellow
and I came back”.

00:54:57.440 --> 00:55:00.960
And he has, one person has transformed
so many villagers!

00:55:00.960 --> 00:55:07.840
And he has made them absolutely without
any bad habits like drinking alcohols

00:55:07.840 --> 00:55:10.800
or anything like that.
All these ‘vyasanas’ [sins],

00:55:10.800 --> 00:55:13.120
all these horrible things
they have given up.

00:55:13.120 --> 00:55:15.280
Just imagine,
villages after villages,

00:55:15.280 --> 00:55:17.440
especially the fishermen,
they have given up.

00:55:17.440 --> 00:55:20.000
Some of them are here
and they are very great people.

00:55:20.000 --> 00:55:23.600
And fishermen are a special,
special for Me,

00:55:23.600 --> 00:55:25.840
because they have been always special,
you know.

00:55:25.840 --> 00:55:28.960
Christ chose all his twelve
disciples from fishermen.

00:55:28.960 --> 00:55:32.000
The reason was, they are very simple
people and they have to deal with the sea.

00:55:32.000 --> 00:55:36.000
Sea is your father, is your guru and about
that, lots of things can be said.

00:55:36.000 --> 00:55:39.600
But the time is so short
and it’s not the talking

00:55:39.600 --> 00:55:42.000
that is going to help you.
It is the Realization.

00:55:42.000 --> 00:55:45.520
So better get your Realization
and pay attention to it.

00:55:45.520 --> 00:55:49.920
The most important thing is to establish
it, and that is the thing you should have.

00:55:49.920 --> 00:55:53.360
You have time for everything
but you have no time for yourself.

00:55:53.360 --> 00:55:55.920
That should not be so.
In the city it happens.

00:55:55.920 --> 00:55:59.680
So have this time for yourself.
You meditate and maintain it.

00:55:59.680 --> 00:56:04.400
And understand all the intricacies
by which you can be harmed. You must know

00:56:04.400 --> 00:56:09.280
how you catch from bad people and how,
what happens, how to protect yourself.

00:56:09.280 --> 00:56:13.600
N ow to protect yourself
you have to give yourself a bandhan.

00:56:13.600 --> 00:56:16.320
It’s a very simple thing
for all of you who have been here,

00:56:16.320 --> 00:56:17.680
you can try this.
Very simple.

00:56:17.680 --> 00:56:19.520
You put this left hand towards Me,
all of you.

00:56:19.520 --> 00:56:21.440
Just put your left hand towards Me,
just like this.

00:56:21.440 --> 00:56:25.520
Left towards Me, all right?
This is the power of desire, all right?

00:56:25.520 --> 00:56:28.080
Left hand, just like this.
Now you put your right hand.

00:56:28.080 --> 00:56:33.120
Now this is your aura around you.
Aura is like an elliptical,

00:56:33.120 --> 00:56:36.560
it’s in that range.
It moves like an aura.

00:56:36.560 --> 00:56:38.880
You put your hand,
the power is flowing through it.

00:56:38.880 --> 00:56:43.040
Just put it on top of your head,
bring it down and push it down once.

00:56:43.040 --> 00:56:46.800
Then again take it back
also and from here.

00:56:46.800 --> 00:56:59.040
Now one, then again, it’s two.
Then again three and this one, like that.

00:56:59.040 --> 00:57:43.440
You do it seven times and you give a
bandhan to yourself [3 and half bandhans].

00:57:44.320 --> 00:57:48.000
Mother’s places are not fashionable,
they are humble and simple.

00:57:48.000 --> 00:57:50.400
But you have to humble down
because you have to get

00:57:50.400 --> 00:57:53.040
your jewels from there,
from the depth of it.

00:57:53.040 --> 00:57:59.920
So, you must have depth to understand
that whatever is simple is the holiest.

00:57:59.920 --> 00:58:02.960
And wherever we have our programs,
you know, we don’t take any money.

00:58:02.960 --> 00:58:06.400
We don’t have much money with us.
We have no ashram, nothing.

00:58:06.400 --> 00:58:10.560
So best thing for you would be to go
to these places in a very humble way.

00:58:10.560 --> 00:58:14.240
It’s a very humble temple.
There’s no shopping centre there.

00:58:14.240 --> 00:58:21.280
Go and achieve your growth
and become absolutely what you are.

00:58:21.280 --> 00:58:25.520
This is what I would bless you with,
with all my desire

00:58:25.520 --> 00:58:29.680
that you become fully grown
into your spiritual life.

00:58:29.680 --> 00:58:38.560
May God bless you.

00:58:38.560 --> 00:58:42.160
Now, why are you standing?
You are tired? Are you?

00:58:42.160 --> 00:58:46.000
Now, please don’t ask questions because
yesterday you saw what a calibre it was.

00:58:46.000 --> 00:58:50.480
I mean, horrid.
I mean, we should have some calibre also.

00:58:50.480 --> 00:58:53.040
Because I was quite
surprised at the calibre.

00:58:53.040 --> 00:58:55.760
But I was also surprised
that all of you got your Realization

00:58:55.760 --> 00:58:59.040
despite all the nonsense he spoke.
And so many of you got it.

00:58:59.040 --> 00:59:06.240
Now, please put your hands towards Me
like this. Just like this.

